    rdfs:comment 'US EPA Maximum Contaminant Level (MCL) for individual PFAS compounds in ng/L. Per EPA PFAS Rule 2024: PFOA = 4 ng/L, PFOS = 4 ng/L. Hazard index compounds (PFNA, PFHxS, PFBS, HFPO-DA) are regulated via hazard index MCL = 1.0.' ;
    rdfs:domain ind:Contaminant ;
    rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

